Find and fix the bugs in this Java method for finding an array's maximum value. Consider null, empty and all-negative arrays as well as `{15, 42, 7, 63, 21}`.

```java
static int findMaxValue(int[] nums) {
    int max = 0;
    for (int i = 1; i <= nums.length; i++) {
        if (nums[i] > max) max = nums[i];
    }
    return max;
